Package: CalTools
Type: Package
Title: Advanced Calibration Diagnostics and Bounded Weight Adjustment
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "pedro.garcia.segador@ine.es")
Description: Calibration with vector bounds, explicitly positive quadratic
    metrics, feasibility diagnostics, minimal directional bound expansion,
    margin aggregation and reproducible search workflows. Low-dimensional
    dual solvers are validated against a quadratic programming reference.
    Includes explanatory consistency diagnostics, nearest consistent totals,
    controlled random stress tests and initial feasibility screening.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, lpSolve, quadprog
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, sampling
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
